"P1191493500" "So, Broken Storm has Lillian. No doubt he seeks revenge for the last time his schemes were foiled by a Warshade. I thank you, {HeroName}, though I will soon need to ask a great favor of you once more. <br><br>Oh, Lillian, what did you get yourself into?"
