// IntroString :
"P3277102801" "The reporter Lillian Issan is still being held by the Outcasts. They plan to cash the bounty on her head to the Council, and take their payment in quantum guns and mercenaries. I know that I have already asked much of you, but I must now ask even more. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>{HeroName}, I must ask you to rescue Lillian from the Outcasts before the Council take her.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2345822749" "Rescue Lillian Issan from the Outcasts"
// SendOffString :
"P840485260" "The Outcast leader, Broken Storm, has crossed paths with we Warshades before. He will no doubt be looking forward to a chance for revenge. Remember, however, that your goal is to find Lillian, or to find out what has become of her."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P916525261" "Find Lillian Issan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P161117595" "Forget Broken Storm, forget the Council. Just find Lillian, {HeroName}."

