"P301434663" "You defeated the Council negotiators, but it was too late. The Council has already taken the reporter Lillian Issan captive!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3224567547" "They already have her? They must not know who she is, or else Arakhn would have contacted me to gloat. This Archon Conway must not know the truth. You have my thanks for even going this far, {HeroName}, but I will have to ask you for more help. I cannot make a move to save Lillian Issan from the Council myself lest I give away her secret and put her in further danger. You see, Lillian Issan is my daughter, and the next in line to become Shadowstar."
// RandomFameString :
"P2266952384" "Did you hear about that missing reporter, Lillian Issan? Rumor is she was investigating the Council when she disappeared."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2.5_Warshade_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P768392023" "My daughter, Lillian Issan, has been taken captive by the Council. She was investigating the Void Hunters, and the Council took notice. Fortunately, it seems that they do not know that Lillian is my daughter, and this gives us a chance to rescue her. I cannot act myself, or they might suspect her connection with me, and she would never be safe again. So I must again ask you for help, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I must ask you to rescue my daughter from the Council.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1315876427" "Rescue Shadowstar's daughter, Lillian Issan, from the Council."
// SendOffString :
"P3958956281" "From the Council agents you captured, we were able to learn where Lillian is being kept, and the name of the base's leader. Rescuing Lillian is my top priority, but you'll also need to make sure that nothing that could prove her true identity remains behind. To do that, you'll also need to access their computer systems, and defeat the base leader, Archon Conway."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2976988346" "Defeat Conway and his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2877128925" "Rescuing Lillian is the top priority, but you'll also need to make sure that nothing that could prove her true identity remains behind. To do that, you'll also need to access their computer systems, and defeat the base leader, Archon Conway."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P299156523" "Lillian Issan's life now rests on your actions. Shadowstar awaits your return, and word of her daughter's fate."

