// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1253303814" "You were too late. Freeflight had already been killed by agents of the Council"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P675152003" "Do not feel that Freeflight's death was your fault. Many more would have died without your work, and my daughter would be at the mercy of the Council. I have been speaking to Sunstorm, and we have been developing a plan to handle this situation. We will likely need to call on you again to help implement it."
// RandomFameString :
"P988835160" "I heard that the Warshades and the Peacebringers are working together on something. I wonder what it could be?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2.5_Warshade_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1690911426" "I have been speaking with Sunstorm, and we've developed a plan to counter the Council's list of known Peacebringers. The problem is that none of his Peacebringers will be able to carry it out. They're all either too well known to the Council, or not powerful enough to accomplish the task. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Therefore, I am asking you for your help to confound the Council.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1000783841" "Help confound the Council"
// SendOffString :
"P893646920" "The plan is in two parts. First, we need you to capture a specific Council computer engineer, a man named Ernie Stover. He's currently examining a potential site for a new Council base beyond Boomtown. Stover has access to the Council's database, and can provide us with the access we'll need for the next part of the plan. Take the train to the area where he is, and search for him there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1777588341" "Capture Lt. Ernie Stover"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2476988021" "You need to capture Lt. Ernie Stover, a Council computer scientist. Take the train to area, and search for him there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P452468900" "Northern Torpedo district"
// EntryString :
"P3328977970" "This section of the city is still in ruins from the war. The perfect place for the Council to hide a new facility."

